  "final_response": "结论：理想类群$Cl(K) \\cong \\mathbb{Z}/2\\mathbb{Z}$。\n\n证明：\n1. Minkowski界：$M_K = \\frac{2}{\\pi} \\sqrt{|D_K|} = \\frac{2}{\\pi} \\sqrt{20} \\approx 2.856 < 3$，故每个理想类含范数$\\leq 2$的积分理想代表。\n2. 素数2分解：$2\\mathcal{O}_K = \\mathfrak{p}_2^2$，其中$\\mathfrak{p}_2 = (2, 1+\\sqrt{-5})$，$N(\\mathfrak{p}_2)=2$。若$\\mathfrak{p}_2=(\\alpha)$，则$N(\\alpha)=a^2+5b^2=2$无整数解，故$\\mathfrak{p}_2$非主；但$\\mathfrak{p}_2^2=(2)$为主理想，故$[\\mathfrak{p}_2]$阶为2。\n3. 素数3分解：$x^2+5 \\equiv 0 \\pmod 3$有解$x=1$，故$3\\mathcal{O}_K = \\mathfrak{p}_3 \\overline{\\mathfrak{p}}_3$，其中$\\mathfrak{p}_3 = (3, 1+\\sqrt{-5})$，$N(\\mathfrak{p}_3)=3$。考虑元素$1+\\sqrt{-5}$，其范数$N(1+\\sqrt{-5})=6=2\\cdot3$，且$1+\\sqrt{-5} \\in \\mathfrak{p}_2$（因$1+\\sqrt{-5} \\equiv 1+1=2 \\equiv 0 \\pmod 2$）且$1+\\sqrt{-5} \\in \\mathfrak{p}_3$，故$(1+\\sqrt{-5}) \\subseteq \\mathfrak{p}_2 \\mathfrak{p}_3$。由范数比较，$(1+\\sqrt{-5}) = \\mathfrak{p}_2 \\mathfrak{p}_3$，故$[\\mathfrak{p}_3] = [\\mathfrak{p}_2]^{-1} = [\\mathfrak{p}_2]$（因$[\\mathfrak{p}_2]^2=1$）。\n4. 综上，所有理想类由$[\\mathcal{O}_K]$和$[\\mathfrak{p}_2]$生成，且$[\\mathfrak{p}_2] \\neq [\\mathcal{O}_K]$，$[\\mathfrak{p}_2]^2 = [\\mathcal{O}_K]$，故$Cl(K) = \\{ [\\mathcal{O}_K], [\\mathfrak{p}_2] \\} \\cong \\mathbb{Z}/2\\mathbb{Z}$。",
